  "description": "<p data-start=\"51\" data-end=\"491\"><strong data-start=\"51\" data-end=\"77\">Mario Golf: Super Rush</strong> is een frisse en toegankelijke <strong data-start=\"109\" data-end=\"122\">sportgame</strong> voor de Nintendo Switch waarin Mario en zijn vrienden het tegen elkaar opnemen op de golfbaan. De game combineert klassieke golfregels met snelle, actiegerichte spelmodi zoals Speed Golf en Battle Golf. Dankzij de kleurrijke banen, unieke personages en verrassende spelelementen is Mario Golf: Super Rush geschikt voor zowel casual spelers als fanatieke Nintendo-fans.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"493\" data-end=\"572\">De game verkeert in <strong data-start=\"513\" data-end=\"531\">In Nette Staat</strong>, is volledig getest en direct speelbaar.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"574\" data-end=\"577\">\r\n<p data-start=\"579\" data-end=\"594\">⭐ <strong data-start=\"581\" data-end=\"594\">Voordelen</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"595\" data-end=\"762\">\r\n<li data-start=\"595\" data-end=\"633\">\r\n<p data-start=\"597\" data-end=\"633\">⛳ Actieve en vernieuwende golfgame</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"634\" data-end=\"673\">\r\n<p data-start=\"636\" data-end=\"673\">🏃 Unieke spelmodi zoals Speed Golf</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"674\" data-end=\"721\">\r\n<p data-start=\"676\" data-end=\"721\">👨‍👩‍👧‍👦 Ideaal voor solo en multiplayer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"762\">\r\n<p data-start=\"724\" data-end=\"762\">🎮 Bekende Mario-personages en banen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"767\">\r\n<p data-start=\"769\" data-end=\"789\">📋 <strong data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"789\">Specificaties</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"790\" data-end=\"983\">\r\n<li data-start=\"790\" data-end=\"819\">\r\n<p data-start=\"792\" data-end=\"819\">Platform: Nintendo Switch</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"820\" data-end=\"853\">\r\n<p data-start=\"822\" data-end=\"853\">Titel: Mario Golf: Super Rush</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"877\">\r\n<p data-start=\"856\" data-end=\"877\">Genre: Sport / Golf</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"919\">\r\n<p data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"919\">Spelmodus: Singleplayer & multiplayer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"920\" data-end=\"957\">\r\n<p data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"957\">Taal: Engels (menu’s en gameplay)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"983\">\r\n<p data-start=\"960\" data-end=\"983\">Staat: In Nette Staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"985\" data-end=\"988\">\r\n<p data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"1008\">📦 <strong data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1008\">Meegeleverd</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1009\" data-end=\"1046\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1009\" data-end=\"1046\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1011\" data-end=\"1046\">Nintendo Switch game <strong data-start=\"1032\" data-end=\"1046\">met doosje</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1051\">\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1114\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">🛡️ <strong data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1075\">Incl. Garantie</strong><br data-start=\"1075\" data-end=\"1078\">Incl. Garantie: <strong data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1114\" data-is-last-node=\"\">1 maand garantie</strong></p>",
